  "ABOUT_TITLE": "About Us",
  "ABOUT_P1": "The story of Dance United begins with a passion that started at the age of three. Our founder, Wiktoria, took her first dance steps at Caro Dance, representing Poland on international stages and earning titles such as Polish Champion and European Vice-Champion.",
  "ABOUT_P2": "Years of training, discipline, and love for movement evolved into a dream: to create a place where dance is not just a sport, but a lifestyle. Dance United was born from this vision—a space where professionals and amateurs alike, regardless of age, can discover and nurture their passion in a supportive, energetic environment.",
  "ABOUT_MISSION_TITLE": "Our Mission",
  "ABOUT_MISSION_TEXT": "\"We believe that dance connects people. Our mission is to build a community where quality instruction meets a friendly atmosphere, empowering everyone to express themselves through movement.\"",
